{"slug":"/students/subjects/biology/biology-transport/","source":"students/subjects/biology/biology-transport.html","area":"students","kind":"division","title":"Transport in Living Organisms - WAEC Biology","description":"","subject":"biology","body":"<!-- Navigation -->\n  <nav class=\"sticky top-0 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-red-100 z-50\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-3\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n        <a href=\"/students/subjects/biology/biology/\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:text-red-700 flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"mi -arrow-left\" data-mi=\"arrow_back\">arrow_back</span>\n          <span>Back to Biology</span>\n        </a>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n          <span class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">WAEC SSCE Biology</span>\n          <span class=\"bg-red-100 text-red-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium\">SS1-SS3</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8\">\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"text-center mb-10\">\n      <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-red-100 text-red-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium mb-4\">\n        <span class=\"mi -heartbeat\" data-mi=\"monitor_heart\">monitor_heart</span>\n        <span>Transport &amp; Circulation</span>\n      </div>\n      <h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Transport in Living Organisms</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n        Transport is essential for moving materials within organisms. Learn about the circulatory system, \n        transport in plants, and the mechanisms that sustain life in this comprehensive WAEC Biology topic.\n      </p>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Learning Objectives -->\n    <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-6 mb-8 border border-red-100\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-red-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\">\n          <span class=\"mi -bullseye text-red-600 text-xl\" data-mi=\"adjust\">adjust</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3\">Learning Objectives</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">By the end of this lesson, you should be able to:</p>\n          <ul class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-3\">\n            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"mi -check-circle text-red-500 mt-1\" data-mi=\"check_circle\">check_circle</span>\n              <span class=\"text-gray-700\">Explain the need for transport systems</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"mi -check-circle text-red-500 mt-1\" data-mi=\"check_circle\">check_circle</span>\n              <span class=\"text-gray-700\">Describe the mammalian circulatory system</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"mi -check-circle text-red-500 mt-1\" data-mi=\"check_circle\">check_circle</span>\n              <span class=\"text-gray-700\">Explain blood composition and functions</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"mi -check-circle text-red-500 mt-1\" data-mi=\"check_circle\">check_circle</span>\n              <span class=\"text-gray-700\">Compare transport in plants and animals</span>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n      <!-- Left Column -->\n      <div class=\"lg:col-span-2 space-y-6\">\n        \n        <!-- Need for Transport -->\n        <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-6 border border-red-100\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-red-500 text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-sm\">1</span>\n            Why Do Organisms Need Transport Systems?\n          </h2>\n          \n          <div class=\"bg-red-50 rounded-xl p-5 mb-5\">\n            <p class=\"text-gray-700\">\n              All living organisms need to move substances from one part of their body to another. \n              This is necessary because cells need nutrients, oxygen, and other materials to survive, \n              and waste products must be removed.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-5\">\n            <div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-4\">\n              <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"mi -box mr-2\" data-mi=\"inventory_2\">inventory_2</span>Materials Transported\n              </h4>\n              <ul class=\"text-gray-700 space-y-1 text-sm\">\n                <li>• <strong>Nutrients:</strong> Glucose, amino acids, fatty acids</li>\n                <li>• <strong>Respiratory gases:</strong> Oxygen, carbon dioxide</li>\n                <li>• <strong>Waste products:</strong> Urea, carbon dioxide</li>\n                <li>• <strong>Hormones:</strong> Chemical messengers</li>\n                <li>• <strong>Water and salts:</strong> For osmoregulation</li>\n                <li>• <strong>Heat:</strong> Temperature regulation</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-green-50 rounded-xl p-4\">\n              <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-green-800 mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"mi -exclamation-circle mr-2\" data-mi=\"error_outline\">error_outline</span>Factors Affecting Transport Need\n              </h4>\n              <ul class=\"text-gray-700 space-y-1 text-sm\">\n                <li>• Size of the organism</li>\n                <li>• Level of metabolic activity</li>\n                <li>• Surface area to volume ratio</li>\n                <li>• Complexity of organization</li>\n                <li>• Environment (aquatic/terrestrial)</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-400 p-4 rounded-r-xl\">\n            <p class=\"text-amber-800 text-sm\">\n              <span class=\"mi -info-circle mr-2\" data-mi=\"info\">info</span>\n              <strong>Key Point:</strong> Small organisms like Amoeba don't need specialized transport systems \n              because they have a large surface area to volume ratio, allowing diffusion to meet their needs.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Transport in Animals -->\n        <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-6 border border-red-100\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-red-500 text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-sm\">2</span>\n            Transport in Animals - The Circulatory System\n          </h2>\n\n          <div class=\"mb-6\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3\">Types of Circulatory Systems</h3>\n            \n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n              <div class=\"bg-purple-50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-purple-200\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-purple-800 mb-2\">Open Circulatory System</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm mb-2\">Blood flows through open spaces (sinuses) in the body.</p>\n                <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm space-y-1\">\n                  <li>• Found in: Insects, molluscs</li>\n                  <li>• Blood not always in vessels</li>\n                  <li>• Low pressure system</li>\n                  <li>• Direct contact with tissues</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"bg-indigo-50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-indigo-200\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-indigo-800 mb-2\">Closed Circulatory System</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm mb-2\">Blood flows entirely within blood vessels.</p>\n                <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm space-y-1\">\n                  <li>• Found in: Vertebrates, annelids</li>\n                  <li>• Blood always in vessels</li>\n                  <li>• High pressure system</li>\n                  <li>• Efficient transport</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Human Heart -->\n          <div class=\"mb-6\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3\">The Human Heart</h3>\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6\">\n              <div class=\"flex justify-center mb-4\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 280\" class=\"w-full max-w-sm\">\n                  <!-- Heart outline -->\n                  <path d=\"M150 250 L50 150 Q30 100 70 70 Q110 40 150 80 Q190 40 230 70 Q270 100 250 150 Z\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"3\"></path>\n                  \n                  <!-- Dividing line (septum) -->\n                  <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>\n                  \n                  <!-- Right atrium -->\n                  <text x=\"100\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\">Right</text>\n                  <text x=\"95\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\">Atrium</text>\n                  \n                  <!-- Left atrium -->\n                  <text x=\"175\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\">Left</text>\n                  <text x=\"175\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\">Atrium</text>\n                  \n                  <!-- Right ventricle -->\n                  <text x=\"90\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\">Right</text>\n                  <text x=\"82\" y=\"192\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\">Ventricle</text>\n                  \n                  <!-- Left ventricle -->\n                  <text x=\"180\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\">Left</text>\n                  <text x=\"175\" y=\"192\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\">Ventricle</text>\n                  \n                  <!-- Vena cava -->\n                  <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"6\"></line>\n                  <text x=\"70\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#3b82f6\">Vena Cava</text>\n                  \n                  <!-- Pulmonary artery -->\n                  <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#60a5fa\" stroke-width=\"4\"></line>\n                  <text x=\"125\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#60a5fa\">Pulmonary Artery</text>\n                  \n                  <!-- Pulmonary vein -->\n                  <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"4\"></line>\n                  <text x=\"190\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#ef4444\">Pulmonary Vein</text>\n                  \n                  <!-- Aorta -->\n                  <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"6\"></line>\n                  <text x=\"210\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#dc2626\">Aorta</text>\n                  \n                  <!-- Valves -->\n                  <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"140\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>\n                  <circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"140\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>\n                  <text x=\"240\" y=\"143\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#f59e0b\">Valves</text>\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-center text-sm text-gray-600\">Structure of the Human Heart</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Blood Vessels -->\n          <div class=\"mb-6\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3\">Blood Vessels</h3>\n            \n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n              <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n                <thead>\n                  <tr class=\"bg-red-100\">\n                    <th class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-red-800\">Feature</th>\n                    <th class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-red-800\">Arteries</th>\n                    <th class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-red-800\">Veins</th>\n                    <th class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-red-800\">Capillaries</th>\n                  </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody class=\"text-gray-700\">\n                  <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2 font-medium\">Wall thickness</td>\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2\">Thick and muscular</td>\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2\">Thin</td>\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2\">One cell thick</td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-red-50/50\">\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2 font-medium\">Lumen size</td>\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2\">Small</td>\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2\">Large</td>\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2\">Very small</td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2 font-medium\">Valves</td>\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2\">Absent</td>\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2\">Present</td>\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2\">Absent</td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-red-50/50\">\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2 font-medium\">Blood pressure</td>\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2\">High</td>\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2\">Low</td>\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2\">Moderate</td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2 font-medium\">Function</td>\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2\">Carry blood away from heart</td>\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2\">Carry blood to heart</td>\n                    <td class=\"border border-red-200 px-3 py-2\">Exchange of materials</td>\n                  </tr>\n                </tbody>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Blood Composition -->\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3\">Composition of Blood</h3>\n            \n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n              <div class=\"bg-red-50 rounded-xl p-4\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-red-800 mb-2\">Blood Plasma (55%)</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm mb-2\">Yellow liquid that carries:</p>\n                <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm space-y-1\">\n                  <li>• Water (90%)</li>\n                  <li>• Proteins (fibrinogen, albumin, globulins)</li>\n                  <li>• Nutrients (glucose, amino acids)</li>\n                  <li>• Waste products (urea)</li>\n                  <li>• Hormones and antibodies</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n              \n              <div class=\"bg-pink-50 rounded-xl p-4\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-pink-800 mb-2\">Blood Cells (45%)</h4>\n                <ul class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm space-y-2\">\n                  <li><strong>Red Blood Cells (Erythrocytes):</strong>\n                    <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-xs ml-4\">\n                      <li>- Transport oxygen (contain hemoglobin)</li>\n                      <li>- Biconcave disc shape</li>\n                      <li>- No nucleus (more space for hemoglobin)</li>\n                    </ul>\n                  </li>\n                  <li><strong>White Blood Cells (Leucocytes):</strong>\n                    <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-xs ml-4\">\n                      <li>- Fight infection (phagocytes &amp; lymphocytes)</li>\n                      <li>- Have nucleus</li>\n                    </ul>\n                  </li>\n                  <li><strong>Platelets (Thrombocytes):</strong>\n                    <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-xs ml-4\">\n                      <li>- Cell fragments for blood clotting</li>\n                    </ul>\n                  </li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Transport in Plants -->\n        <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-6 border border-red-100\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-red-500 text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-sm\">3</span>\n            Transport in Plants\n          </h2>\n\n          <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">\n            Plants have a vascular system consisting of two types of transport tissues: xylem and phloem.\n          </p>\n\n          <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6\">\n            <div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-blue-200\">\n              <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <span class=\"mi -arrow-up text-blue-600\" data-mi=\"arrow_upward\">arrow_upward</span>\n                Xylem\n              </h4>\n              <ul class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm space-y-2\">\n                <li><strong>Transports:</strong> Water and dissolved minerals</li>\n                <li><strong>Direction:</strong> Upward (roots → leaves)</li>\n                <li><strong>Structure:</strong> Dead, hollow cells with lignified walls</li>\n                <li><strong>Types:</strong> Vessels, tracheids, xylem fibers, xylem parenchyma</li>\n                <li><strong>Mechanism:</strong> Transpiration pull, root pressure, capillary action</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-green-50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-green-200\">\n              <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-green-800 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <span class=\"mi -exchange-alt text-green-600\" data-mi=\"swap_horiz\">swap_horiz</span>\n                Phloem\n              </h4>\n              <ul class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm space-y-2\">\n                <li><strong>Transports:</strong> Sugars (sucrose) and organic compounds</li>\n                <li><strong>Direction:</strong> Both directions (translocation)</li>\n                <li><strong>Structure:</strong> Living cells (sieve tubes, companion cells)</li>\n                <li><strong>Types:</strong> Sieve tube elements, companion cells, phloem fibers, phloem parenchyma</li>\n                <li><strong>Mechanism:</strong> Mass flow hypothesis (pressure flow)</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Transpiration -->\n          <div class=\"bg-teal-50 rounded-xl p-5\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-teal-800 mb-3\">\n              <span class=\"mi -water mr-2\" data-mi=\"water\">water</span>Transpiration\n            </h3>\n            <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-3\">\n              The loss of water vapor from plant leaves through stomata. It creates a pulling force that draws water up through the xylem.\n            </p>\n            \n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n              <div>\n                <h4 class=\"font-medium text-teal-700 mb-2\">Factors Affecting Transpiration:</h4>\n                <ul class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm space-y-1\">\n                  <li>• <strong>Temperature:</strong> Higher temp → faster transpiration</li>\n                  <li>• <strong>Humidity:</strong> Lower humidity → faster transpiration</li>\n                  <li>• <strong>Wind:</strong> More wind → faster transpiration</li>\n                  <li>• <strong>Light intensity:</strong> More light → stomata open → faster</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <h4 class=\"font-medium text-teal-700 mb-2\">Importance:</h4>\n                <ul class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm space-y-1\">\n                  <li>• Creates transpiration pull for water movement</li>\n                  <li>• Cools the plant</li>\n                  <li>• Helps in mineral absorption</li>\n                  <li>• Maintains turgidity of cells</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Worked Examples -->\n        <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-6 border border-red-100\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-red-500 text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-sm\">4</span>\n            Worked Examples\n          </h2>\n\n          <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n            <!-- Example 1 -->\n            <div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 mb-3\">\n                <span class=\"bg-red-500 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded text-sm font-medium\">WAEC 2021</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 px-2 py-1 rounded text-sm\">Theory</span>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-800 font-medium mb-3\">\n                Describe the adaptations of the mammalian heart to its function.\n              </p>\n              <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 border border-gray-200\">\n                <p class=\"font-semibold text-red-700 mb-2\">Solution:</p>\n                <ul class=\"text-gray-700 space-y-2 text-sm\">\n                  <li><strong>1. Muscular walls:</strong> The heart has thick muscular walls (myocardium) that contract to pump blood. The left ventricle has the thickest wall because it pumps blood to the entire body.</li>\n                  <li><strong>2. Valves:</strong> Tricuspid, bicuspid (mitral), and semilunar valves prevent backflow of blood, ensuring one-way flow.</li>\n                  <li><strong>3. Septum:</strong> Divides the heart into left and right sides, preventing mixing of oxygenated and deoxygenated blood.</li>\n                  <li><strong>4. Four chambers:</strong> Two atria receive blood, two ventricles pump blood out, allowing efficient double circulation.</li>\n                  <li><strong>5. Coronary vessels:</strong> Supply the heart muscle with oxygen and nutrients for continuous pumping.</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Example 2 -->\n            <div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 mb-3\">\n                <span class=\"bg-red-500 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded text-sm font-medium\">WAEC 2019</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 px-2 py-1 rounded text-sm\">Theory</span>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-800 font-medium mb-3\">\n                State three differences between arteries and veins.\n              </p>\n              <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 border border-gray-200 overflow-x-auto\">\n                <p class=\"font-semibold text-red-700 mb-2\">Solution:</p>\n                <table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\n                  <thead>\n                    <tr class=\"border-b border-gray-300\">\n                      <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-2\">Arteries</th>\n                      <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-2\">Veins</th>\n                    </tr>\n                  </thead>\n                  <tbody class=\"text-gray-700\">\n                    <tr class=\"border-b border-gray-200\">\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">Carry blood away from the heart</td>\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">Carry blood towards the heart</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"border-b border-gray-200\">\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">Have thick, muscular walls</td>\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">Have thin walls</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"border-b border-gray-200\">\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">Have narrow lumen</td>\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">Have wide lumen</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"border-b border-gray-200\">\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">No valves</td>\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">Have valves</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">Blood flows under high pressure</td>\n                      <td class=\"py-2 px-2\">Blood flows under low pressure</td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </tbody>\n                </table>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Right Column - Sidebar -->\n      <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n        \n        <!-- Video Resource -->\n        <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden border border-red-100\">\n          <div class=\"bg-red-500 text-white px-4 py-3\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-semibold flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"mi -play-circle\" data-mi=\"play_circle\">play_circle</span>\n              Video Lesson\n            </h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"aspect-video\">\n            <iframe class=\"w-full h-full\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CWFyxn0RuDE\" title=\"Circulatory System\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\">\n            </iframe>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"p-4\">\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">\n              <span class=\"mi -info-circle text-red-500 mr-1\" data-mi=\"info\">info</span>\n              Learn about the human circulatory system and blood vessels.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Quick Facts -->\n        <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-5 border border-red-100\">\n          <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"mi -lightbulb text-red-500\" data-mi=\"lightbulb\">lightbulb</span>\n            Quick Facts\n          </h3>\n          <div class=\"space-y-3 text-sm\">\n            <div class=\"bg-red-50 rounded-lg p-3\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-red-800\">Heart Rate</p>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Average adult: 72 beats/min</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-red-50 rounded-lg p-3\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-red-800\">Blood Volume</p>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-600\">About 5 liters in average adult</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-red-50 rounded-lg p-3\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-red-800\">Blood Types</p>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-600\">A, B, AB, O (each + or -)</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-red-50 rounded-lg p-3\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-red-800\">Blood Pressure</p>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Normal: 120/80 mmHg</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Key Terms -->\n        <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-5 border border-red-100\">\n          <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"mi -book text-red-500\" data-mi=\"menu_book\">menu_book</span>\n            Key Terms\n          </h3>\n          <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n            <div class=\"border-l-4 border-red-400 pl-3\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">Double Circulation</p>\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Blood passes through heart twice per circuit</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"border-l-4 border-red-400 pl-3\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">Systole/Diastole</p>\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Contraction/Relaxation phases of heart</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"border-l-4 border-red-400 pl-3\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">Translocation</p>\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Movement of sugars in phloem</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"border-l-4 border-red-400 pl-3\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">Transpiration Pull</p>\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Force that draws water up xylem</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Quick Quiz -->\n        <section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-5 border border-red-100\">\n          <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"mi -question-circle text-red-500\" data-mi=\"help\">help</span>\n            Quick Quiz\n          </h3>\n          <div id=\"quiz-container\" data-bidemy=\"quiz\">\n            <div class=\"quiz-question mb-4\" data-question=\"1\">\n              <p class=\"text-gray-700 font-medium mb-3 text-sm\">1. Which blood vessel carries blood away from the heart?</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-3 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-red-400 transition text-sm\">\n                  A. Vein\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-3 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-red-400 transition text-sm\">\n                  B. Artery\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-3 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-red-400 transition text-sm\">\n                  C. Capillary\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-3 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-red-400 transition text-sm\">\n                  D. Venule\n                </button>\n              </div>\n              <div id=\"feedback-q1\" class=\"mt-2 hidden text-sm\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-question=\"2\">\n              <p class=\"text-gray-700 font-medium mb-3 text-sm\">2. Xylem transports:</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-3 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-red-400 transition text-sm\">\n                  A. Sugars\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-3 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-red-400 transition text-sm\">\n                  B. Water and minerals\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-3 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-red-400 transition text-sm\">\n                  C. Proteins\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"quiz-option w-full text-left px-3 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg hover:border-red-400 transition text-sm\">\n                  D. Hormones only\n                </button>\n              </div>\n              <div id=\"feedback-q2\" class=\"mt-2 hidden text-sm\"></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"mt-4 w-full bg-red-500 text-white py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-red-600 transition font-medium text-sm\">\n            Check Answers\n          </button>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Scripts -->\n  \n\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-gradient-to-br from-red-50 via-white to-orange-50 min-h-screen","bodyStyle":"","css":["body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n    .accordion-content { max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.3s ease-out; }\n    .accordion-content.open { max-height: 2000px; }\n    .quiz-option:hover { transform: translateX(4px); }\n    .quiz-option.selected { background: #dbeafe; border-color: #3b82f6; }\n    .quiz-option.correct { background: #dcfce7; border-color: #22c55e; }\n    .quiz-option.incorrect { background: #fee2e2; border-color: #ef4444; }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}